  "description": "NavAIgate Workspace for bb: run-sheet sidebar with tags, later flags, folders and multi-select; a to-do list linked to chats and folders with a self-moving Board; Control room; usage dock; charts in replies; the NavAIgate theme.",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
